{"id":"4019930989297139155","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"CAN WE TALK ABOUT STANDING AT SEATED CONCERTS?! 👀\n\nIf everyone stands up, what happens to the disabled people who can’t?\n\nI’ll go first: I love live music, but I can’t always stand for an entire concert. Having a seat doesn’t help much when everyone in front of me is standing.\n\nHow do we make concerts enjoyable for everyone without taking away anyone else’s experience? 💗","username":"cognitive.confetti","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@cognitive.confetti/post/DfJqe-uo_3T","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:52:19Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:33.801550344Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:39.914176Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:39.914176Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_4fac59fec983a774","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
