{"id":"4019971895134847449","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"I wish they would designate the first 10 rows of any concert as exclusive seating zones (at least in one section). The people in the rows behind can see, the people who want to be close and stand can sit in a different section and those who want to just sit or who find standing difficult can do so without having their view obstructed.  Basically, a seating accessible area where you are informed that standing, other than to leave to use the facilities will result in you being asked to leave","username":"rosiefoxrocks","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@rosiefoxrocks/post/DfJzyPQkQHZ","timestamp":"2026-10-31T09:13:35Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:33.801601028Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:39.914176Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-31T10:02:39.914176Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_85f086eda20f9771","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
